# Fetched at package time (bundled Node binaries) — never committed.
vendor/
# Assembled at package time from the built server and web client.
staging/
# electron-builder output. No trailing slash: package.mjs makes it a symlink
# when the workspace is inside a synced folder (see CLAUDE.md, Signing).
out
# The root .gitignore excludes build/ (a build-output convention); here it is
# electron-builder's *input* directory — the app icon lives in it.
!/build/
